{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視（TVB）真人騷《中年好聲音4》即將於今晚（8月23日）晚上7時30分 於翡翠台現場直播總決賽《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》，終極7強名單包括：鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、尹景順、吳亦偉、許雲妮、尤淑情及許美琪。跟過往大騷一樣，《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》亦有紅地氈環節。</p><p>以下立即帶大家睇睇各人的盛裝：</p><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253085173420032569072.jpeg/t7o77mM-heoHkgLe-KD_wc0rKmuTqSEaxhkpY8YZKWM\"/><figcaption>曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253082744786944025436.jpeg/UM-eJDqFWEbQb5Lwi_5Z7ut-esRaJJ39mAnJbpgJyW4\"/><figcaption>曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253080110632960896542.jpeg/KNUMG8tGcigzFhL3NYm6j2jFsfpDrmyOxT443MU-ONw\"/><figcaption>曾志偉帶領頭三屆參賽者入場。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253689128161280053267.jpeg/uV3nUveclt283B0sq306ufXZngU-wi2ezvjYWc742Fk\"/><figcaption>難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253686632419328869521.jpeg/NsmdZBzX9QneMycYwuNdO25M1IKWlu-lF14fRRdeH0U\"/><figcaption>難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253684119900160130264.jpeg/H9xvfqdOwjT9bLHLXjmdYzCcL3BT5JKTDi1TCw4tUws\"/><figcaption>難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168253681661906944047691.jpeg/A8IWamsvKH0jo_S2yf44Sk0onML5v4NTv7-Nor-_jaI\"/><figcaption>難得咁人齊。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"支嚳儀今晚好靚。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168255316849070080089436.jpeg/0FM_X_9TC6dX3B337nv-HjCbcE-5PM86qj-4d6o_uHc\"/><figcaption>支嚳儀今晚好靚。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《中3》女子組。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168258063937966080270158.jpeg/Y3rhfH93PpwoVvAjFsf-9DlU4NVKCTw810MhJddDISU\"/><figcaption>《中3》女子組。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《中3》女子組。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168258061538693120928160.jpeg/Pp3H89kSlI7AyEzd6lPDtRAgIDb1HAwFePB9EHjwfRA\"/><figcaption>《中3》女子組。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬浩宜露長腿唔輸蝕。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168258878673129472930874.jpeg/aGBzXOGMwTQHV5skbKqZDg8OslGgaEyDrCg1KawoNSk\"/><figcaption>馬浩宜露長腿唔輸蝕。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬浩宜露長腿唔輸蝕。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168258876177387520897521.jpeg/vbVNH-hPralgtUX2yYrM_OVlYZOqBEdKdsdtA3bHbQM\"/><figcaption>馬浩宜露長腿唔輸蝕。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《中4》TVB藝人參賽者。（YouTube截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168259652413034496518209.jpeg/cVKBncfHLC5UjK1GpoR4O3AYfpDk_BYbUP4pOFD-KTg\"/><figcaption>《中4》TVB藝人參賽者。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T10:18:49.364463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":424,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}